      "messages": {
        "145400000": {
          "id": 145400000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1409,
          "text": "這裡是賽事討論群組，所有參加錦標賽的選手都在喔",
          "next": [
            145400001
          ]
        },
        "145400001": {
          "id": 145400001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1409,
          "text": "灰寶跟大家打個招呼",
          "next": [
            145400002,
            145400005
          ]
        },
        "145400002": {
          "id": 145400002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "奇美拉對戰，用實力說話",
          "next": [
            145400003
          ]
        },
        "145400003": {
          "id": 145400003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "我將擊敗你們，證明自己是翁法羅斯第一訓練家",
          "next": [
            145400004
          ]
        },
        "145400004": {
          "id": 145400004,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "next": [
            145400008
          ]
        },
        "145400005": {
          "id": 145400005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "我才剛打完定級賽，還是個新人",
          "next": [
            145400006
          ]
        },
        "145400006": {
          "id": 145400006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "各位，下手別太重",
          "next": [
            145400007
          ]
        },
        "145400007": {
          "id": 145400007,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "next": [
            145400008
          ]
        },
        "145400008": {
          "id": 145400008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "好搭檔，難得有和你碰面的機會，這次，讓我們用各自的奇美拉一決高下吧！",
          "next": [
            145400009
          ]
        },
        "145400009": {
          "id": 145400009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "哼…別輸得太慘，救世主",
          "next": [
            145400022
          ]
        },
        "145400010": {
          "id": 145400010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "想阻擋我的征途？呵…看你是否有這個實力",
          "next": [
            145400011
          ]
        },
        "145400011": {
          "id": 145400011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1410,
          "text": "無妨，我會掃清凱撒前方的一切障礙",
          "next": [
            145400012
          ]
        },
        "145400012": {
          "id": 145400012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1406,
          "text": "嗨～灰子～來個交易怎麼樣？我替你偷走對面的奇美拉，你故意放水輸給我",
          "next": [
            145400013
          ]
        },
        "145400013": {
          "id": 145400013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1402,
          "text": "別鬧了，賽法利婭，你明明知道你是瞞不過金線的",
          "next": [
            145400014
          ]
        },
        "145400014": {
          "id": 145400014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1403,
          "text": "不准串通作弊！*我們*會當裁判，監督所有人的！",
          "next": [
            145400015
          ]
        },
        "145400015": {
          "id": 145400015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "既是裁判，又是選手，這樣的安排何來公正可言？",
          "next": [
            145400016
          ]
        },
        "145400016": {
          "id": 145400016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1403,
          "text": "唔…緹寶來對戰，緹寧做裁判，緹安抓壞蛋。嗯，這樣就好！",
          "next": [
            145400017
          ]
        },
        "145400017": {
          "id": 145400017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1002,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}，這場奇美拉賽事，我也將全力以赴",
          "next": [
            145400018,
            145400019
          ]
        },
        "145400018": {
          "id": 145400018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "認真起來的丹恆，光想就感覺強得可怕",
          "next": [
            145400020
          ]
        },
        "145400019": {
          "id": 145400019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "好啊，我也要拿出全部本事來應戰！",
          "next": [
            145400020
          ]
        },
        "145400020": {
          "id": 145400020,
          "type": "Text",
